{"strongs": "H0197", "word": "אוּלָם", "translit": "u.lam", "root": "אול", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "porch", "definition": "I. אוּלָם noun masculine 1Kgs 7:8 porch (compare אֵילָם ) — ׳ א absolute 1Kgs 6:3 +; אֻלָם Ezek 40:48 ; Ezek 40:49 construct אוּלָם 1Kgs 7:6 +; אֻלָם Ezek 40:7 + (margin אֻלָּם 1Kgs 7:7 ; 1Kgs 7:12 ; 1Kgs 7:21 ); plural construct אֻלַמֵּי Ezek 41:15 ( Co singular with suffix; in Ezekiel Co reads everywhere אילם see אֵילָם below) — porch (only Kings Chronicles Ezekiel & Joel). 1. in Soloman's temple 1Kgs 7:19 ; 2Chr 29:7 , יהוה ׳ א v 2Chr 29:17 ; 2Chr 8:12 (altar in front of); יהוה ׳ א 2Chr 15:8 (id.), compare בֵּין הָאוּלָם וּבֵין הַמִּזְבֵּחַ Ezek 8:16 & Joel 2:17 הַהֵיכָל ׳ א 1Kgs 7:21 הַבַּיִת ׳ א v 1Kgs 7:12 ׳ תַּבְנִית הָא 1Chr 28:11 . 2. in Solomon's palace 1Kgs 7:8 (twice in verse); הָעַמּוּדִים ׳ א 1Kgs 7:6 compare v 1Kgs 7:6 הַכִּסֵּא ׳ א 1Kgs 7:7 = הַמִּשְׁפָּט ׳ א v 1Kgs 7:7 . 3. in temple of Ezekiel's vision, particularly הַשַּׁעַר ׳ א Ezek 40:7 ; Ezek 40:8 (strike out Co see ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ᵑ9 ):9.9.15.39.40; Ezek 44:3 ; Ezek 46:2 ; Ezek 46:8 הַבַּיִת ׳ א Ezek 40:48 compare v Ezek 40:48 v Ezek 40:49 ; Ezek 41:25 ; Ezek 41:26 אֻלַמֵּי הֶחָצֵר Ezek 41:25 Co singular ואילמו החיצון see אֵילָם . — (III. אוּלָם , adverb.)", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB199')\">BDB199</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H197')\">H197</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB198')\">BDB198</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB200')\">BDB200</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>אוּלָם</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,8)\">1Kgs 7:8</ref></sup> porch (compare <bdbheb>אֵילָם</bdbheb>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,3)\">1Kgs 6:3</ref> +; <bdbheb>אֻלָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:48\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,48)\">Ezek 40:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,49)\">Ezek 40:49</ref> construct <bdbheb>אוּלָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,6)\">1Kgs 7:6</ref> +; <bdbheb>אֻלָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,7)\">Ezek 40:7</ref> + (margin <bdbheb>אֻלָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,7)\">1Kgs 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,12)\">1Kgs 7:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,21)\">1Kgs 7:21</ref>); plural construct <bdbheb>אֻלַמֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,15)\">Ezek 41:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> singular with suffix; in Ezekiel <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> reads everywhere <bdbheb>אילם</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>אֵילָם</reflink></bdbheb> below) — <highlight>porch</highlight> (only Kings Chronicles Ezekiel &amp; Joel). <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> in Soloman's temple <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,19)\">1Kgs 7:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,7)\">2Chr 29:7</ref>, <bdbheb>יהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Chr 29:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,17)\">2Chr 29:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,12)\">2Chr 8:12</ref> (altar in front of); <bdbheb>יהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 15:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,15,8)\">2Chr 15:8</ref> (id.), compare <bdbheb>בֵּין הָאוּלָם וּבֵין הַמִּזְבֵּחַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,16)\">Ezek 8:16</ref> &amp; <ref ref=\"Joel 2:17\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,17)\">Joel 2:17</ref> <bdbheb>הַהֵיכָל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,21)\">1Kgs 7:21</ref> <bdbheb>הַבַּיִת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,12)\">1Kgs 7:12</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תַּבְנִית הָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 28:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,28,11)\">1Chr 28:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in Solomon's palace <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,8)\">1Kgs 7:8</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>הָעַמּוּדִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,6)\">1Kgs 7:6</ref> compare v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,6)\">1Kgs 7:6</ref> <bdbheb>הַכִּסֵּא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,7)\">1Kgs 7:7</ref> = <bdbheb>הַמִּשְׁפָּט</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,7)\">1Kgs 7:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in